  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Science/Indigenous Knowledge Unite to Reduce Forest Carbon Loss - Peru</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This component of the program &#x201c;Science/Indigenous Knowledge Unite to Reduce Forest Carbon Loss&#x201d; aims to reduce forest carbon emissions from indigenous landscapes caused by deforestation and forest degradation in Peru, using a combination of scientific and local knowledge.</narrative>
  </description>
